1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,700
Maa... bohot tez bukhaar hai...
kaash aap yahan hoti...

2
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:25,100
Mummy... aap itni raat ko
gaon se kaise aayi?

3
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,100
Tujhe bukhaar ho, aur mujhe
pata na chale? Chal, doodh pee le.

4
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,100
Hello? Papa?
Mummy kahan hai?

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,100
Kabir... beta jaldi gaon aa ja!

6
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:45,100
Teri Mummy... raat 12 baje heart attack.
Woh chali gayi beta.

7
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:49,100
Aakhri saans tak bas tera
naam le rahi thi...

8
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:52,200
Mera Kabir... mujhe
uske paas jaana hai...
